# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Documentation (`docs/`)

Welcome to the documentation repository for **{{PROJECT_NAME}}**.

This repository is the central source of truth for engineering architecture, CLI manuals, active design specifications, and operational runbooks.

---

## Documentation Structure (3 Tiers)

```
docs/
├── system/                 # Tier 1: Living System Truth (Architecture & CLI Manuals)
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md     # Master system architecture & technical blueprints
│   ├── MANUAL.md           # CLI tools reference, commands & usage workflows
│   └── INDEX.md            # Catalog of system manuals
│
├── design/                 # Tier 2: Transitional Blueprints (Active Stages & Epics)
│   ├── templates/          # Standard templates for new epics & RFCs
│   │   └── epic.template.md# The structured Google-style epic blueprint
│   ├── INDEX.md            # Active & in-progress design specs table
│   └── archive/            # Landed/completed epics preserved for history
│
└── support/                # Tier 3: Operations & Troubleshooting (Living)
    ├── RUNBOOK.md          # Operational runbooks & debugging guides
    └── INDEX.md            # Catalog of operational docs
```

