## For Agents & Developers

- Read [system/ARCHITECTURE.md](system/ARCHITECTURE.md) to understand the technical architecture.
- Read [system/MANUAL.md](system/MANUAL.md) for command lines, workflows, and tool usage.
- To start a new stage or feature, instantiate [design/templates/epic.template.md](design/templates/epic.template.md) into `design/<slug>.md`.
